/T (over-allocation, lost fee records and slow complaint handling. This project presents Hostel Accommodation and Student Services, a web-based database admin panel that centralises the records of hostel staff, hostel blocks, rooms, students, fee payments, complaints, mess subscriptions and visitors.)
/E (over-allocation, lost fee records and slow complaint handling. This project presents Hostel Accommodation and Student Services, a web-based database admin panel that centralises the records of hostel staff, hostel blocks, rooms, students, fee payments, complaints, mess subscriptions and visitors.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 114 0 R
/T (The system is built on a normalised MySQL database of eight related tables connected through primary and foreign keys. The application is developed with Node.js \(v24.15.0\), run with npm start, and provides a browser interface with a sidebar for each module where an administrator can insert, view and delete records. Drop-down lists are filled from related tables so that only valid foreign-key values can be chosen. SQL joins, aggregates and subqueries generate reports such as room occupancy, block-wise strength, unpaid fees and open complaints.)
/E (The system is built on a normalised MySQL database of eight related tables connected through primary and foreign keys. The application is developed with Node.js \(v24.15.0\), run with npm start, and provides a browser interface with a sidebar for each module where an administrator can insert, view and delete records. Drop-down lists are filled from related tables so that only valid foreign-key values can be chosen. SQL joins, aggregates and subqueries generate reports such as room occupancy, block-wise strength, unpaid fees and open complaints.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
