/T (Database Admin Panel. A dark teal header carries the title, and a left sidebar lists the eight modules: Staff, Hostel Block, Room, Student, Fee Payment, Complaint, Mess and Visitor. Each module page has two cards: an Add New Record form on top \(required fields marked with *\) and an Existing Records table below with a Delete button on each row. Drop-down lists for foreign keys \(warden, block, room, student\) are filled from the related tables, and a green message confirms a successful insert.)
/E (Database Admin Panel. A dark teal header carries the title, and a left sidebar lists the eight modules: Staff, Hostel Block, Room, Student, Fee Payment, Complaint, Mess and Visitor. Each module page has two cards: an Add New Record form on top \(required fields marked with *\) and an Existing Records table below with a Delete button on each row. Drop-down lists for foreign keys \(warden, block, room, student\) are filled from the related tables, and a green message confirms a successful insert.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7]
